<title>INDONESIA: Jakarta stock market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Jakarta stock market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Jakarta stock exchange was closed on Wednesday for a Hindu holiday. Trading will resume on Thursday.</p>
<p>On Tuesday, the Jakarta composite index rose 1.58 points, or 0.25 percent, to close at 638.22 points.</p>
<p>Advancers led decliners by 53 to 47 with 84 issues unchanged.</p>
<p>Total turn-over was 354.20 billion rupiah against 302 billion rupiah on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta Newsroom + 6221 384-6364</p>
